| :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| teacher | 1.209513 | 0.4185655 | 104 / 128 |
| baseline | 1.012782 | 0.555691 | 99 / 128 |
| logits | 2.662024 | 2.221887 | 103 / 128 |
| features | 3.114705 | 2.562616 | 102 / 128 |
| self | 2.645299 | 2.344598 | 98 / 128 |
